gametitle=Baldur's Gate - Dark Alliance II (SLUS-20675)

[3 Player mod]
author=H + Claude
description=Test build 51. Needs the 3P ISO made by make_3p_iso.bat (the one from build 40, with the Dark Alliance 1 heroes and their spoken lines; no new ISO for this build) and Multitap on port 1. New game: choose Three Player; on the character screen keep pressing right past the five figures for Human Archer, Elven Sorceress, Dwarven Fighter.
