[P3 character - Dorn]
author=H + Claude
description=Only for loading a save that has no player 3 in it: player 3 joins as a new Dorn instead of a copy of player 2. New games ignore this - pick Three Player in the menu.
patch=0,EE,000A1BE8,word,50330005

[P3 character - Vhaidra]
author=H + Claude
description=Only for loading a save that has no player 3 in it: player 3 joins as a new Vhaidra instead of a copy of player 2. New games ignore this - pick Three Player in the menu.
patch=0,EE,000A1BE8,word,50330006

[P3 character - Ysuran]
author=H + Claude
description=Only for loading a save that has no player 3 in it: player 3 joins as a new Ysuran instead of a copy of player 2. New games ignore this - pick Three Player in the menu.
patch=0,EE,000A1BE8,word,50330007

[P3 character - Borador]
author=H + Claude
description=Only for loading a save that has no player 3 in it: player 3 joins as a new Borador instead of a copy of player 2. New games ignore this - pick Three Player in the menu.
patch=0,EE,000A1BE8,word,50330008

