[TEST - DA1 boss: Beholder in Trollbark Forest]
author=H + Claude
description=TEST ONLY (build 48). In Trollbark Forest the Beholder (on the DA2 disc already) joins goblins 629 / 630 half way along the forest. Stats come from the level formula (Lilivarra and the Beholder have fixed boss hit points). Killed ones stay dead like any other enemy. Restart the game after ticking.
