[TEST - DA1 boss: Lilivarra in Trollbark Forest]
author=H + Claude
description=TEST ONLY (build 48). In Trollbark Forest Lilivarra, the drow priestess of Dark Alliance 1, waits at the goblin camp before the goblin lair and attacks on sight (her DA1 dialogue is skipped). NEEDS the [3P] ISO rebuilt with LILVARRA.LMP (make_3p_iso.bat); without it nothing is placed. Stats come from the level formula (Lilivarra and the Beholder have fixed boss hit points). Killed ones stay dead like any other enemy. Restart the game after ticking.
