description=TEST ONLY (build 48). In Trollbark Forest the Minotaur of Dark Alliance 1 joins goblins 642 / 643 in the first fight from the Trade Way. NEEDS the [3P] ISO rebuilt with MINOTAUR.LMP (make_3p_iso.bat); without it nothing is placed. Stats come from the level formula (Lilivarra and the Beholder have fixed boss hit points). Killed ones stay dead like any other enemy. Restart the game after ticking.
