[Shops - fresh random stock every visit, more items]
author=H + Claude
description=Shops roll their stock afresh each time they open: the weapons tab is 20 random weapons and the armour tab 20 random armour pieces (no fixed lists any more); the other tab keeps its usual potions and gems plus 10 random items, priced anywhere from cheap to very expensive with the whole range rising by act. On Extreme the random items are worth at least 5000 (weapons) / 3000 (armour) / 1000 (other) gold from act 2 on; potions and gems keep their prices. (The game only had random stock on Extreme, 17 / 17 / 8 items that came out the same every visit.) Takes effect at the next shop visit.
