[Feats - new rank costs, Vahn + Borador + Kromlech extras]
author=H + Claude
description=Build 50. Feat prices per rank as H set them (Power Attack 2/4/6/8/10, Sunder 5/9/14/17/20 ... 58 feats; a price is per feat, so a feat shared by several characters changes for all of them). Vahn's Accuracy becomes the five-rank DA2 one (2/4/6/8/10) and he gets Precise Shot, which now also works with bows; Borador gets Exploding Arrows and Enchant Arrows, and Exploding Arrows now also works with crossbows; Kromlech gets Power Attack, Sunder and Cleave (build 51). New feats appear at the end of the feat list. Restart the game after ticking; saved characters keep their ranks.
